# Only the web app is built into the image. The docs package.json is kept so
# `bun i --frozen-lockfile` still sees the whole workspace.
@robopo/docs/**
!@robopo/docs/package.json
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env*
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.devcontainer
.github
.vscode
*.md
